        <figcaption><b>Figure 2.</b> In both, the core is one thin shaded strip and everything else sits beside it as a separate piece that can be loaded, replaced or removed on its own. Column for column: drivers, file systems and servers line up with the three kinds of skill; <code>modprobe</code> and the pager line up with the skill manager and the context skill. <b>The self-improving skill has no counterpart</b> &mdash; the dashed column is the part this design adds.</figcaption>
